<title>UK: INSIGHT-Coffee seen stabilising, support to hold.</title>
<headline>INSIGHT-Coffee seen stabilising, support to hold.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>SEPT     Close  * Support * Resist * RSI14 *   MA10 *   MA40</p>
<p>COFFEE    1,778 *  1,695  *  1,845 *  42.0 *  1,896 *  1,899</p>
<p>---------------VIEWS FROM THE MARKET - June 17----------------</p>
<p>LIFFE coffee futures are stabilising between $1,696 and $1,845 basis September after the sharp downward correction from the peak of $2,700 seen in late May, technical analysts said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Traders called the market to open $40-$50 a tonne higher. New York arabica coffee futures ended mixed on Monday ahead of the May U.S. consumer coffee stock figures.</p>
